## Evidence index

```
REPORT.md                       this file
verification-verdicts.json      every independent verdict (lens, severity, confidence, evidence, caveats)
ehbp-h2-retry-plaintext/        Finding 1: PoC repos (EHBP HEAD, EHBP v0.3.2, tinfoil-go) and evidence/
python-tdx-collateral-dupkey/   Finding 2: evidence/ (hunter PoC, verifier scripts and outputs)
cee-snapshot-auth-bypass/       Finding 3: evidence/ (run scripts, outputs, race test)
ehbp-response-forgery/          Finding 4: evidence/
summarizer-postsend-pin/        Finding 5: evidence/
```

The verifier PoC files are drop-ins for the repository checkout and version named in each file's
directory. Most need the local Go 1.27.1, Node or Python toolchains only.
